speechtext:
Mr. Speaker, I should like to ask the minister a question. In view of the urgency surrounding the depletion of our marine resources by foreign nationals, namely, the Soviet Union, can he indicate if his department and the government are planning to take immediate initiatives to convene an international conference on marine resources involving discussions on management and conservation of the fishing resources off both the Atlantic and Pacific coasts.
22478-64}
Inquiries of the Ministry
